    "entityTitle": "Loaned accessible reading device and specialist charging accessories",
    "description": "The loaned reading device was returned with an intermittent power complaint and a bag of specialist charging accessories. The receiving team must retain the full intake note, including the requirement to erase locally stored reading material, count the separately packaged cable adaptors, and document the next custodian before any onward routing occurs.",
